[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:121. The Man in a Hat]
[00:02.060]Lesson 121 | 第121課
[00:04.955]I bought two expensive dictionaries here half an hour ago, but I forgot to take them with me. | 半小時前我在這裡買了兩本昂貴的詞典，但我忘了帶走它們。
[00:13.530]Who served you, sir? | 先生，是誰為您服務的？
[00:16.220]The lady who is standing behind the counter. | 站在櫃檯後面的那位女士。
[00:19.970]Which books did you buy? | 您買了哪些書？
[00:22.635]The books which are on the counter. | 櫃檯上的那些書。
[00:25.705]Did you serve this gentleman half an hour ago, Miss Roberts? | 羅伯茨小姐，半小時前您為這位先生服務過嗎？
[00:30.685]He says he's the man who bought these books. | 他說他就是買這些書的人。
[00:34.205]I can't remember, sir. | 先生，我不記得了。
[00:36.900]The man whom I served was wearing a hat. | 我服務的那個人戴著帽子。
[00:40.920]Have you got a hat, sir? | 先生，您有帽子嗎？
[00:43.355]Yes, I have. | 是的，我有。
[00:45.245]Would you put it on, please? | 請您戴上好嗎？
[00:47.660]All right. | 好的。
[00:49.670]Is this the man that you served, Miss Roberts? | 羅伯茨小姐，這就是您服務過的那個人嗎？
[00:53.655]Yes, sir. I recognize him now. | 是的，先生。我現在認出他了。